$DATUM Dibromostilbene, 7. C60Br8 (100 mg, 0.074 mmol and trans-stilbene (40mg,
0.222mmol) were dissolved in 30mL of 1,1,2,2-tetrachloroethane. The
reaction mixture was heated to 90°C for 12 hours. Subsequently the
solution was cooled to room temperature and all volatiles removed. The
residue was chromatographed on silica using hexane as the eluent, 21 mg,
83%.
