$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (2S,7S)-bis(2-((3-((tert-Butoxycarbonyl)(propyl)amino)propyl)amino)-2-oxoethyl)
2,7-bis(((benzyloxy) carbonyl)amino)-4,5-dibromooctanedioate (mixture of
the 4R,5S and 4S,5R diastereoisomers) 28. To a cold (0°C) solution of 47
mg (0.048 mmol) of alkene 27 in 1.2 mL of CH2Cl2 was added 69 mg (1.9
mmol) of pyridinium tribromide (tech., 90%). The reaction mixture was
allowed to warm to room temperature and was stirred for a total of 16 h.
The mixture was diluted with ethyl acetate, washed with 5% aq. citric
acid, water, and brine, and dried over MgSO4. The dried solution was
filtered, the solvents removed under reduced pressure, and the residue
was purified by flash chromatography. 46 mg (84% yield) of 28 as a
mixture of the 4R,5S and 4S,5R dibromide diastereoisomers. IR (film) ν
3320, 3064, 3035, 2969, 2935, 2876, 1753, 1688, 1665, 1543, 1422, 1366,
1251, 1154, 1051, 738, 698 cm-1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.72 (t, 1H, J
= 6.0 Hz), 7.65 (t, 1H, J = 6.0 Hz), 7.42-7.24 (m, 10H), 6.81 (d, 1H, J =
8.6 Hz), 6.74 (d, 1H, J = 9.1 Hz), 5.19-5.06 (m, 4H), 4.91-4.62 (m, 4H),
