$DATUM Dichlorostilbene, 7. C60Cl6 (100 mg, 0.107 mmol) and trans-stilbene
(40mg, 0.222mmol) were dissolved in 30mL of 1,1,2,2-tetrachloroethane.
The reaction mixture was heated to 90°C for 12 hours. Subsequently the
solution was cooled to room temperature and all volatiles removed. The
residue was chromatographed on a silica column using hexane as the
eluent, Yield 22 mg, 82%.
